+# SDL_GPU Material-Group Scan (2026-10-19)
+
+This runtime scan checks the current NAP-backed SDL_GPU VMesh diagnostic after
+selection was changed to rank complete same-material groups per `VMeshRef`.
+The diagnostic draws one selected material from one CMP component through the
+production PBR shader. It does not render a complete ship or the full game scene.
+
+## Build and package
+
+- `lancer` Release build: 0 warnings, 0 errors.
+- Active package: `cmp-multisubmesh-qa-20261019`.
+- Archive: `Data/NAP/.runtime-test-stage/cmp-multisubmesh-20261019/application/packages/cmp-multisubmesh-qa.nap`.
+- Archive size: 156,076,390 bytes; SHA-256: `4e3f1a57410f44866400184cb374cb6ba468932902cd4b4bbcada08fcf39aea7`.
+- `nexus-pack verify` checked all 23 entries. The 23 staged inputs were copied from files under `Data/NAP/`; `provenance.json` records each source path, size, and hash. The runtime application had an active NAP manifest and no loose `DATA` directory.
+
+## Runtime results
+
+All ten selected ship/base-independent ship CMP materials presented on SDL_GPU/Vulkan and passed the four real VMesh readback probes. The renderer reported both selected and maximum same-material header counts as one in every scanned CMP. Therefore this package confirms the mapped production material path and selection scan, but does not contain a runtime example with multiple headers sharing a material.
+
+| CMP | Selected component | Indices | Selected headers | Maximum headers in scan | Coverage |
+|---|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|
+| `Models/ships/order/or_osiris/or_osiris.cmp` | `osiris_rear_lod1` | 1,446 | 1 | 1 | 4/4 |
+| `Models/ships/rheinland/rh_battleship/rh_battleship.cmp` | `Rh_midfrnt_lod1` | 2,070 | 1 | 1 | 4/4 |
+| `Models/ships/liberty/li_dreadnought/li_dreadnought.cmp` | `Li_frnt_lod1` | 2,670 | 1 | 1 | 4/4 |
+| `Models/ships/bretonia/br_battleship/br_battleship.cmp` | `Root` | 810 | 1 | 1 | 4/4 |
+| `Models/ships/kusari/ku_battleship/ku_battleship.cmp` | `Ku_front_lod1` | 1,758 | 1 | 1 | 4/4 |
+| `Models/ships/utility/mining/mining_tuck.cmp` | `Root` | 1,152 | 1 | 1 | 4/4 |
+| `Models/ships/rheinland/rh_cruiser/rh_cruiser.cmp` | `Rh_reactor_lod1` | 1,320 | 1 | 1 | 4/4 |
+| `Models/ships/liberty/li_cruiser/li_cruiser.cmp` | `Root` | 2,691 | 1 | 1 | 4/4 |
+| `Models/ships/kusari/ku_destroyer/ku_destroyer.cmp` | `ku_reactor_lod1` | 1,596 | 1 | 1 | 4/4 |
+| `Models/ships/bretonia/br_destroyer/br_destroyer.cmp` | `Root` | 504 | 1 | 1 | 4/4 |
+
+The test ran on Mesa/Vulkan Intel Haswell, whose Vulkan support reports as
+incomplete. The smoke capture also contains synthetic diagnostic and shadow
+panels; it is not evidence of visual quality or a GPU compatibility matrix.
+A real multi-header same-material asset, full CMP composition, DFM skinning,
+other backends, and production scene acceptance remain open.
